1822
01:50:55,023 --> 01:50:57,985
this is what
you've been up to.

1823
01:50:58,777 --> 01:50:59,945
Yes.

1824
01:51:00,112 --> 01:51:02,030
What you have here, now,

1825
01:51:03,282 --> 01:51:07,494
is a chance to restore
Wakanda's protector.

1826
01:51:07,578 --> 01:51:13,000
(SCOFFS IN DISBELIEF)
It would be the greatest gift

1827
01:51:13,458 --> 01:51:15,794
since Bashenga's discovery.

1828
01:51:20,924 --> 01:51:23,177
We'll soon find out. Come.

1829
01:51:26,305 --> 01:51:27,764
-GRIOT?
-GRIOT: Yes, Princess.

1830
01:51:27,848 --> 01:51:28,932
SHURI: Print it.

1831
01:51:33,103 --> 01:51:34,813
NAKIA: How will we know
if it works?

1832
01:51:35,606 --> 01:51:36,857
SHURI: If it glows.

1833
01:51:43,197 --> 01:51:44,448
(BOTH GASP)

1834
01:51:45,991 --> 01:51:47,159
(IN XHOSA)

1835
01:51:48,285 --> 01:51:49,703
(NAKIA LAUGHS)

1836
01:51:51,914 --> 01:51:52,998
(IN ENGLISH) I mean,
shouldn't we be

1837
01:51:53,081 --> 01:51:54,374
burning incense or something?

1838
01:51:55,000 --> 01:51:56,084
Only Bast knows

1839
01:51:56,168 --> 01:51:58,170
how the ancestors
will make it to this lab.

1840
01:52:08,513 --> 01:52:10,349
Are you sure you don't want me
to bury you?

1841
01:52:10,515 --> 01:52:11,516
No.

1842
01:52:12,100 --> 01:52:14,144
Need you to have access
to my chest,

1843
01:52:14,311 --> 01:52:16,355
just in case
I go through cardiac arrest.

1844
01:52:16,939 --> 01:52:18,482
"Cardiac arrest"?

1845
01:52:19,566 --> 01:52:20,609
She's joking,

1846
01:52:21,151 --> 01:52:22,402
right?

1847
01:52:23,570 --> 01:52:25,405
-(KIMOYO BEADS TRILL)
-Right?

1848
01:52:26,907 --> 01:52:29,076
(SIGHS DEEPLY)

1849
01:52:30,369 --> 01:52:34,206
Allow this Heart-Shaped Herb

1850
01:52:34,581 --> 01:52:37,626
to give you the strength
of the Black Panther

1851
01:52:38,043 --> 01:52:40,462
and take you
to the Ancestral Plane.

1852
01:52:44,716 --> 01:52:46,051
(IN XHOSA)

1853
01:52:49,805 --> 01:52:52,057
(SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC BUILDING)

1854
01:52:54,309 --> 01:52:55,310
(MUSIC STOPS)

1855
01:52:57,646 --> 01:52:58,981
(NAKIA CHANTS IN XHOSA)

1856
01:53:00,649 --> 01:53:02,192
(NAKIA AND RIRI
CHANTING IN XHOSA)

1857
01:53:02,276 --> 01:53:03,986
(HEART BEATING)

1858
01:53:10,284 --> 01:53:11,285
(HEARTBEAT STOPS)

1859
01:53:31,930 --> 01:53:33,432
(PANTING)

1860
01:53:33,515 --> 01:53:35,851
(LOW EERIE MUSIC PLAYING)

1861
01:53:59,750 --> 01:54:00,751
(IN ENGLISH) Mother?

1862
01:54:14,097 --> 01:54:15,349
N'Jadaka.

1863
01:54:15,932 --> 01:54:17,100
Lil' cousin.

1864
01:54:17,476 --> 01:54:18,477
How?

1865
01:54:18,560 --> 01:54:21,396
How is never as important
as why, right?

1866
01:54:23,190 --> 01:54:24,441
You chose me.

1867
01:54:24,608 --> 01:54:27,486
Impossible.
I would never choose you.

1868
01:54:27,652 --> 01:54:29,321
Why did you take the Herb?

1869
01:54:30,322 --> 01:54:32,282
-To see my family.
-No, that's bullshit.

1870
01:54:33,241 --> 01:54:35,160
You didn't believe
the Ancestral Plane was real,

1871
01:54:35,243 --> 01:54:36,244
did you?

1872
01:54:39,373 --> 01:54:40,374
No.

1873
01:54:41,124 --> 01:54:42,376
So, why did you take it, then?

1874
01:54:44,086 --> 01:54:45,462
You don't have to lie to me.

1875
01:54:46,296 --> 01:54:47,798
So I can be strong.

1876
01:54:48,173 --> 01:54:49,674
Strong to do what?

1877
01:54:52,552 --> 01:54:53,553
See?

1878
01:54:55,097 --> 01:54:57,057
We're more alike
than you think.

1879
01:54:58,975 --> 01:55:00,936
I took it to avenge
my ancestors too.

1880
01:55:01,103 --> 01:55:02,270
I'm nothing like you.

1881
01:55:03,730 --> 01:55:05,482
You took it for yourself,

1882
01:55:05,649 --> 01:55:07,192
then destroyed the rest.

1883
01:55:08,693 --> 01:55:09,903
Unworthy king,

1884
01:55:10,737 --> 01:55:12,239
afraid of being replaced.

1885
01:55:13,323 --> 01:55:14,324
Just a coward.

1886
01:55:14,491 --> 01:55:15,492
No.

1887
01:55:15,575 --> 01:55:16,618
I had the courage to do

1888
01:55:16,701 --> 01:55:18,245
what was necessary
to change Wakanda.

1889
01:55:19,663 --> 01:55:21,164
How many people
like your scientist

1890
01:55:21,248 --> 01:55:23,625
did Wakanda protect
before I took the throne?

1891
01:55:24,668 --> 01:55:25,669
Cowards.

1892
01:55:25,836 --> 01:55:28,088
That was the Panthers
that came before me,

1893
01:55:29,172 --> 01:55:30,173
and before T'Challa.

1894
01:55:30,257 --> 01:55:32,092
Don't mention my brother.

1895
01:55:32,426 --> 01:55:34,094
You're the reason
why he's dead.

1896
01:55:34,594 --> 01:55:37,848
You burnt the Herb,
left us with no protector.

1897
01:55:38,014 --> 01:55:40,267
Then Namor struck
and killed my mother.

1898
01:55:40,434 --> 01:55:42,269
Their blood is on your hands.

1899
01:55:43,437 --> 01:55:44,771
That ain't on me.

1900
01:55:45,313 --> 01:55:46,690
And don't you dare

1901
01:55:46,857 --> 01:55:48,692
take that away
from your mother.

1902
01:55:48,859 --> 01:55:50,444
She sacrificed her life
to protect

1903
01:55:50,527 --> 01:55:52,362
a young girl
from the lost tribe.

1904
01:55:53,738 --> 01:55:56,408
Your father,
he was a hypocrite.

1905
01:55:57,909 --> 01:55:59,661
He would've killed that girl.

1906
01:56:00,370 --> 01:56:02,289
Shit, he killed
his own brother.

1907
01:56:03,874 --> 01:56:06,543
T'Challa was too noble.

1908
01:56:08,712 --> 01:56:11,047
He let the man
who murdered your father live.

1909
01:56:13,175 --> 01:56:14,843
And here you stand.

1910
01:56:20,515 --> 01:56:22,642
Are you gonna be noble
like your brother

1911
01:56:22,809 --> 01:56:24,895
or take care of business...

1912
01:56:25,604 --> 01:56:26,730
like me?

1913
01:56:28,398 --> 01:56:29,483
(YELPS)

1914
01:56:29,566 --> 01:56:30,567
NAKIA: Are you okay?

1915
01:56:30,984 --> 01:56:32,652
(GASPING)

1916
01:56:32,736 --> 01:56:33,904
(IN XHOSA)

1917
01:56:36,448 --> 01:56:37,532
(IN ENGLISH) Who did you see?

1918
01:56:43,038 --> 01:56:44,039
No one.

1919
01:56:47,292 --> 01:56:48,293
(IN XHOSA)

1920
01:56:48,919 --> 01:56:50,337
(IN ENGLISH) I failed.

1921
01:56:50,504 --> 01:56:52,631
-It didn't work.
-Hey, Shuri.

1922
01:56:55,759 --> 01:56:58,136
-They abandoned me.
-They would never do that.

1923
01:56:58,220 --> 01:56:59,763
I did everything
I was supposed to do.

1924
01:56:59,846 --> 01:57:01,681
-I re-created the Herb.
-Okay.

1925
01:57:01,765 --> 01:57:03,808
I just did your stupid ritual,
and for what?

1926
01:57:03,975 --> 01:57:05,519
-Relax.
-Why didn't they come for me?

1927
01:57:05,602 --> 01:57:06,728
Just relax.

1928
01:57:09,481 --> 01:57:10,941
(GRUNTS IN FRUSTRATION)

1929
01:57:13,818 --> 01:57:15,111
BOTH: Shit.

1930
01:57:19,449 --> 01:57:20,784
Can I get some of that too?

1931
01:57:28,208 --> 01:57:29,251
I think...

1932
01:57:30,794 --> 01:57:32,254
you're going to need a suit.

1933
01:57:35,507 --> 01:57:37,717
(PENSIVE MUSIC PLAYING)

1934
01:57:51,147 --> 01:57:53,483
(SLOW SYNTH MUSIC PLAYING)

1935
01:58:03,868 --> 01:58:05,870
TRIBE ELDER 1: There are more
people coming from the city.

1936
01:58:05,954 --> 01:58:07,581
M'BAKU: They need more space.

1937
01:58:07,747 --> 01:58:08,748
So what?

1938
01:58:09,624 --> 01:58:11,876
You are visitors.

1939
01:58:12,043 --> 01:58:15,255
It is a wonder how anything
gets done with you people.

1940
01:58:15,338 --> 01:58:16,339
(FALTERS)

1941
01:58:17,173 --> 01:58:18,675
(ENGINE HUMMING)

1942
01:58:24,806 --> 01:58:27,017
(SLOW SYNTH MUSIC PLAYING)

1943
01:58:40,405 --> 01:58:42,699
-(ALL EXCLAIM)
-TRIBE ELDER 2: The princess!

1944
01:58:53,668 --> 01:58:55,128
(M'BAKU CLEARS THROAT)

1945
01:58:57,047 --> 01:58:59,382
(JABARIS HOOTING)

1946
01:59:02,510 --> 01:59:04,512
(MUSIC INTENSIFIES)

1947
01:59:04,596 --> 01:59:06,097
(HOOTING CONTINUES)

1948
01:59:13,021 --> 01:59:14,314
(HOOTING SUBSIDES)

1949
01:59:16,232 --> 01:59:17,525
M'BAKU: She has done it!

1950
01:59:18,234 --> 01:59:21,237
-The Black Panther lives!
-(JABARIS ULULATING)

1951
01:59:21,321 --> 01:59:24,324
-(JABARIS CHANTING)
-(ZAWAVARI SINGING IN XHOSA)

1952
01:59:28,370 --> 01:59:30,538
(JABARIS CONTINUE CHANTING)

1953
01:59:39,089 --> 01:59:41,508
Namor believes
Wakanda is on her knees.

1954
01:59:43,968 --> 01:59:45,428
Our Queen murdered.

1955
01:59:47,931 --> 01:59:49,474
Our capital destroyed.

1956
01:59:51,142 --> 01:59:52,977
He believes
we have no protector.

1957
01:59:54,979 --> 01:59:55,980
But now...

1958
01:59:57,774 --> 01:59:59,776
now is our time to strike.

1959
01:59:59,943 --> 02:00:03,530
ELDER: How, when we don't
even know how to find him?

1960
02:00:04,114 --> 02:00:05,824
We'll bring Namor to us.

1961
02:00:05,990 --> 02:00:07,534
-Here, again?
-SHURI: No.

1962
02:00:07,701 --> 02:00:10,036
A distant location at sea.

1963
02:00:10,203 --> 02:00:11,621
M'BAKU: All right.

1964
02:00:11,705 --> 02:00:13,164
Let's say this does work.

1965
02:00:14,457 --> 02:00:17,210
Hmm. Assuming
we can kill this man

1966
02:00:17,377 --> 02:00:20,422
who can fly and is potentially
as strong as the Hulk...

1967
02:00:23,174 --> 02:00:25,593
is murdering him
the right solution?

1968
02:00:26,052 --> 02:00:28,012
TRIBE ELDER 2:
You were calling for his head

1969
02:00:28,179 --> 02:00:30,515
when his only crime
was intimidation.

1970
02:00:30,682 --> 02:00:32,475
What has changed, Lord M'Baku?

1971
02:00:32,642 --> 02:00:33,852
His soldiers

1972
02:00:34,018 --> 02:00:35,729
did not call him
General or King.

1973
02:00:35,812 --> 02:00:38,481
They called him K'uk'ulkan.

1974
02:00:38,648 --> 02:00:39,858
What is that?

1975
02:00:40,024 --> 02:00:42,152
The feather serpent god.

1976
02:00:42,736 --> 02:00:43,737
What?

1977
02:00:43,820 --> 02:00:45,822
Do you think because we are
living in the mountains,

1978
02:00:45,989 --> 02:00:47,866
we do not have access
to books?

1979
02:00:48,116 --> 02:00:49,617
-(CHUCKLES)
-SHURI: Elders,

1980
02:00:50,034 --> 02:00:51,411
with your permission,

1981
02:00:51,578 --> 02:00:55,290
I would like to talk
with Lord M'Baku alone.

1982
02:00:56,666 --> 02:00:57,667
(ELDERS SPEAKING XHOSA)

1983
02:01:05,425 --> 02:01:06,760
(IN ENGLISH)
Namor's not finished.

1984
02:01:08,178 --> 02:01:11,264
He promised to destroy
the surface world.

1985
02:01:11,431 --> 02:01:13,767
Now is our opportunity
to take him.

1986
02:01:13,933 --> 02:01:16,186
-What are you afraid of?
-M'BAKU: War.

1987
02:01:16,603 --> 02:01:19,939
If Namor is indeed
a god to his people,

1988
02:01:20,106 --> 02:01:22,734
killing him
will risk eternal war.

1989
02:01:22,817 --> 02:01:23,985
SHURI: And so what?

1990
02:01:24,527 --> 02:01:26,863
Was my mother's life
not worth eternal war?

1991
02:01:27,030 --> 02:01:28,406
M'BAKU: Of course it was.

1992
02:01:29,407 --> 02:01:33,495
Of course she was.

1993
02:01:35,497 --> 02:01:38,708
But it is not what she would
have wanted for you.

1994
02:01:39,959 --> 02:01:40,960
Hmm?

1995
02:01:44,172 --> 02:01:45,882
And it is not what I want...

1996
02:01:48,510 --> 02:01:50,261
for my people.

1997
02:01:58,228 --> 02:02:00,522
(SOMBER MUSIC PLAYING)

1998
02:02:00,605 --> 02:02:03,650
You speak of my mother
as if she's still here.

1999
02:02:04,567 --> 02:02:06,569
Of what she would've
wanted for me.

2000
02:02:07,654 --> 02:02:09,948
Her hopes and her dreams.

2001
02:02:13,117 --> 02:02:14,619
But she's dead.

2002
02:02:15,662 --> 02:02:16,663
She's gone!

2003
02:02:18,373 --> 02:02:22,252
Namor drowned her,
right in front of me!

2004
02:02:23,670 --> 02:02:24,963
So, her dreams,

2005
02:02:25,129 --> 02:02:28,216
her goals, her hopes for me...

2006
02:02:31,553 --> 02:02:32,804
it doesn't exist.

2007
02:02:35,515 --> 02:02:37,058
It doesn't matter anymore.

2008
02:02:39,143 --> 02:02:42,021
What matters is what I want,

2009
02:02:42,188 --> 02:02:44,899
and what I want is Namor dead!

2010
02:02:48,903 --> 02:02:50,572
And you're going
to help me get it.

2011
02:02:58,121 --> 02:02:59,289
(IN XHOSA)

2012
02:03:04,002 --> 02:03:05,128
(GRUNTS)

2013
02:03:06,838 --> 02:03:08,464
(IN ENGLISH)
We leave in the morning.

2014
02:03:11,050 --> 02:03:13,261
(TENSE PERCUSSION MUSIC
PLAYING)

2015
02:03:34,282 --> 02:03:35,283
NAKIA: Hi.

2016
02:03:35,450 --> 02:03:36,451
Good morning.

2017
02:03:39,078 --> 02:03:40,288
If we survive this,

2018
02:03:41,956 --> 02:03:45,168
I want you to know you have
a home with me in Haiti.

2019
02:03:48,004 --> 02:03:50,340
Here. Take my hands.

2020
02:03:52,133 --> 02:03:53,551
(SHURI EXHALES)

2021
02:03:53,635 --> 02:03:54,636
(IN XHOSA)

2022
02:03:55,803 --> 02:03:57,221
(BREATHES DEEPLY)

2023
02:03:59,015 --> 02:04:01,517
(IN ENGLISH) Shuri, I want you
to be honest with me.

2024
02:04:01,684 --> 02:04:04,729
Who did you see
when you took the Herb?

2025
02:04:09,901 --> 02:04:11,611
If you go to war
for vengeance,

2026
02:04:11,694 --> 02:04:14,197
it will not fill the hole
left from her loss.

2027
02:04:14,781 --> 02:04:16,658
It will only grow larger,

2028
02:04:16,824 --> 02:04:18,284
and it will consume you.

2029
02:04:20,536 --> 02:04:21,913
It already has.

2030
02:04:27,293 --> 02:04:29,212
(IN MAYAN)

2031
02:04:36,427 --> 02:04:38,388
(SINISTER MUSIC PLAYING)

2032
02:04:50,149 --> 02:04:51,609
(WHALE CALLING)

2033
02:04:52,360 --> 02:04:54,362
(UNSETTLING MUSIC PLAYING)

2034
02:05:02,286 --> 02:05:03,830
(HIGH-PITCHED SOUND WAVES
BLASTING)

2035
02:05:11,504 --> 02:05:13,256
(WARRIORS GROANING)

2036
02:05:15,842 --> 02:05:17,844
(DRAMATIC MUSIC PLAYS)

2037
02:05:24,142 --> 02:05:26,602
(ALL CHANTING IN XHOSA)

2038
02:05:34,777 --> 02:05:35,862
(NAMOR GRUNTS)

2039
02:05:37,280 --> 02:05:38,448
(YELLS)

2040
02:05:41,784 --> 02:05:43,119
(GROWLING)

2041
02:05:45,538 --> 02:05:47,373
(GUN CHARGING)

2042
02:05:51,294 --> 02:05:52,587
(IN ENGLISH) For the Queen.

2043
02:05:55,381 --> 02:05:56,716
(GRUNTING)

2044
02:05:59,010 --> 02:06:00,344
(NAMOR YELLING)

2045
02:06:04,140 --> 02:06:05,808
(WAKANDANS SCREAMING)

2046
02:06:08,436 --> 02:06:10,980
(SOUND WAVES PULSING)

2047
02:06:12,774 --> 02:06:14,692
(GRUNTING IN EXERTION)

2048
02:06:15,068 --> 02:06:16,569
(YELLS)

2049
02:06:20,823 --> 02:06:22,533
-(SHOUTS)
-(WARRIORS GRUNT)

2050
02:06:23,951 --> 02:06:25,995
(ROUSING MUSIC PLAYING)

2051
02:06:26,079 --> 02:06:27,497
Phambill!

2052
02:06:28,664 --> 02:06:29,874
(ALL HOOTING)

2053
02:06:29,957 --> 02:06:31,709
(ALL YELLING)

2054
02:06:38,091 --> 02:06:39,342
(SHURI YELLS)

2055
02:06:42,053 --> 02:06:43,304
(HEROIC MUSIC PLAYS)

2056
02:06:43,805 --> 02:06:45,473
(WARRIORS GRUNTING)

2057
02:06:47,433 --> 02:06:48,434
(SHURI GRUNTS)

2058
02:06:49,060 --> 02:06:51,145
(ALL SCREAMING AND GRUNTING)

2059
02:06:58,236 --> 02:06:59,237
(CLAW SLICES)

2060
02:07:02,740 --> 02:07:03,991
(SHURI GRUNTING)

2061
02:07:06,661 --> 02:07:08,412
SHURI: (ON COMMS) Rin,
how's it going up there?

2062
02:07:08,913 --> 02:07:10,164
RIRI: (ON COMMS)
Hey, Mr. GRIOT.

2063
02:07:10,248 --> 02:07:11,707
I could really use
that backup right now.

2064
02:07:11,874 --> 02:07:13,835
GRIOT: / thought
you'd never ask.

2065
02:07:14,877 --> 02:07:16,003
(BOTH GRUNT)

2066
02:07:19,632 --> 02:07:20,633
RIRI: Shit.

2067
02:07:22,218 --> 02:07:23,469
(GRUNTS)

2068
02:07:25,096 --> 02:07:26,472
Shit, he's fast.

2069
02:07:27,140 --> 02:07:28,349
But I'm faster.

2070
02:07:29,308 --> 02:07:30,476
(SUIT BEEPS)

2071
02:07:33,980 --> 02:07:35,565
Whoo!

2072
02:07:48,327 --> 02:07:49,370
I got you.

2073
02:07:49,787 --> 02:07:50,788
(NAMOR GRUNTS)

2074
02:07:55,710 --> 02:07:57,044
It's on you now, Shuri.

2075
02:08:04,594 --> 02:08:06,137
(TENSE MUSIC PLAYING)

2076
02:08:06,220 --> 02:08:07,597
-Princess.
-SHURI: No.

2077
02:08:08,097 --> 02:08:11,601
lam the Black Panther,
and I'm here for retribution!

2078
02:08:12,268 --> 02:08:15,271
GRIOT: Pervaporation cells
activated.

